# be-architect #1 · WhisperKit checks for the STT design · 2026-11-14 (UTC 22:32–22:36)
Clips made in a scratch dir (not committed), same commands as be-analyst #1:
$ say -v "Flo (Chinese (China mainland))" -o zh.wav --data-format=LEI16@16000 "可是晚上和朋友吵架了，有点难过。"
$ say -v Samantha -o en.wav --data-format=LEI16@16000 "I just got the internship!"
$ python3 -I -c "<2 s of zeros, 16 kHz mono 16-bit>" -> silence.wav
M626 = ~/Documents/huggingface/models/argmaxinc/whisperkit-coreml/openai_whisper-large-v3-v20240930_626MB
MFULL = ~/Documents/huggingface/models/argmaxinc/whisperkit-coreml/openai_whisper-large-v3-v20240930 (1.5G)

$ whisperkit-cli transcribe --model-path $M626 --audio-path zh.wav              -> 可是婉双和朋友吵架了,有点难过。  real 2.40
$ whisperkit-cli transcribe --model-path $M626 --audio-path en.wav              -> I just got the internship.       real 1.66
$ whisperkit-cli transcribe --model-path $M626 --audio-path silence.wav         -> Продолжение следует...           real 1.62
$ whisperkit-cli transcribe --language zh --model-path $M626 --audio-path zh.wav -> 可是婉双和朋友吵架了,有点难过。
$ whisperkit-cli transcribe --model-path $M626 --language en --use-prefill-prompt --audio-path silence.wav -> Thank you.
$ whisperkit-cli transcribe --language zh --model-path $MFULL --audio-path zh.wav -> 可是婉娃和朋友吵架了,有点难过。  real 1.88, then 1.36
(Placing --language after --audio-path failed with "Error: The file doesn't exist." — --audio-path takes several values.)

Findings used in 03:
- Both large-v3 variants were already warm (no ~390 s compile) for whisperkit-cli; mishearing of 晚上 is the same in both,
  CER 2/15 = 13% on this synthetic line.
- Silence becomes text with auto language (Russian) and with forced English ("Thank you.") -> an audio-level guard is needed.
- WhisperKit 1.1.1 hard-codes noSpeechProb = 0 (Sources/WhisperKit/Core/TextDecoder.swift:820 "TODO: implement no speech
  prob"), so a noSpeechThreshold guard can never fire -> guard with EnergyVAD (Core/Audio/EnergyVAD.swift:7-41) instead.
- detectLangauge(audioArray:) returns only the sampled language (TextDecoder.swift:516-528, WhisperKit.swift:546-590).
- Tokenizer is found locally at ~/Documents/huggingface/models/openai/whisper-large-v3/tokenizer.json; WhisperKit loads a
  local tokenizer before trying the Hub (Utilities/ModelUtilities.swift:24-75).
- whisperkit-cli serve writes each upload to the temp dir and never deletes it (Sources/ArgmaxCLI/Server/OpenAIHandler.swift:
  140-147, no removal in the handler) -> rejected for A9.
